    hook: "Right now, are you happy? Sad? Excited? Tired? That thing inside you that tells you how you are doing — that is a feeling. Everyone has feelings, and they change all the time. Even Sage the Deer has feelings — she feels calm in the meadow and nervous when she hears a loud noise. Today you will discover the wonderful world of feelings.",
