    activity: { title: "Body Map", instructions: "Draw an outline of a body on a big piece of paper (or trace your own body lying on butcher paper). Now think about a time you felt really happy — color where you felt it in your body using a warm color like yellow or orange. Then think about a time you felt really scared — color where you felt that in a cool color like blue or purple. Do the same for angry (red) and sad (gray or dark blue). Your Body Map shows where your feelings live!" },
